#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:279
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:401
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Your coding agent"
msgstr "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Ihr Codierungsagent"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:234
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:256
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:284
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:406
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:448
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopieren"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:253
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Or run this command in your terminal:"
msgstr "Oder führen Sie diesen Befehl in Ihrem Terminal aus:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:265
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Review the plan, approve the setup, then restart your agent. Already "
"connected? Continue below."
msgstr ""
"Überprüfen Sie den Plan, genehmigen Sie die Einrichtung und starten Sie dann"
" Ihren Agenten neu. Bereits verbunden? Weiter unten."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:271
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "2. Ask where the CSV is written"
msgstr "2. Fragen Sie, wo der CSV geschrieben ist"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:272
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The example is a six-file Electron app with an {ph0}Export notes{ph1} "
"button. Your agent can inspect its code without installing or launching "
"Electron."
msgstr ""
"Das Beispiel ist eine Electron-App mit sechs Dateien und einem {ph0}Notizen "
"exportieren{ph1} Schaltfläche. Ihr Agent kann seinen Code überprüfen, ohne "
"Electron zu installieren oder zu starten."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:307
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent downloads the files and gives the unpacked folder to REA for "
"inspection."
msgstr ""
"Ihr Agent lädt die Dateien herunter und gibt den entpackten Ordner zur "
"Überprüfung an REA weiter."

#. {ph0}: <a class="button" href="../examples/notes-example.zip"
#. download="notes-example.zip" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:311
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Download example ZIP{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Beispiel-ZIP herunterladen{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes-example</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:319
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"If your agent can’t download files, unzip this archive yourself. Give it the"
" path to the {ph0} folder and the same export question."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Ihr Agent keine Dateien herunterladen kann, entpacken Sie dieses Archiv"
" selbst. Gib ihm den Weg zum {ph0} ordner und die gleiche Exportfrage."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:326
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "3. Follow the answer back to the code"
msgstr "3. Folgen Sie der Antwort zurück zum Code"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:327
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Look for a short explanation with file and line references:"
msgstr ""
"Suchen Sie nach einer kurzen Erklärung mit Datei- und Zeilenreferenzen:"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>notes.csv</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>id</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>title</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:329
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The button sends a {ph0} message. The main process formats the notes as CSV "
"and writes {ph1} in the user’s Downloads folder. The columns are {ph2} and "
"{ph3}."
msgstr ""
"Die Schaltfläche sendet eine {ph0} Nachricht. Der Hauptprozess formatiert "
"die Notizen als CSV und schreibt {ph1} im Download-Ordner des Benutzers. Die"
" Spalten sind {ph2} und {ph3}."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:337
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "From the button to the file writer"
msgstr "Von der Schaltfläche zum Dateischreiber"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:366
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA’s static analysis pairs the message with its handler. The destination is"
" read from code."
msgstr ""
"Die statische Analyse von REA koppelt die Nachricht mit ihrem Handler. Das "
"Ziel wird aus dem Code gelesen."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:382
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The file path, formatter and write call are together in this handler. Ask "
"your agent to show these lines if its answer leaves them out."
msgstr ""
"Der Dateipfad, der Formatierer und der Schreibaufruf sind in diesem Handler "
"zusammen. Bitten Sie Ihren Agenten, diese Zeilen zu zeigen, wenn die Antwort"
" sie auslässt."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/#follow" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:387
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}See the full code trace and recorded REA result{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Sehen Sie sich den vollständigen Code-Trace und das aufgezeichnete REA-"
"Ergebnis an{ph1}."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:394
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "4. Check a prediction"
msgstr "4. Überprüfen Sie eine Vorhersage"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:395
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"A comma separates CSV columns. What happens when a note title itself "
"contains a comma or quotation marks?"
msgstr ""
"Die Spalten CSV werden durch ein Komma getrennt. Was passiert, wenn ein "
"Notiztitel selbst ein Komma oder Anführungszeichen enthält?"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:439
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Run the check yourself"
msgstr "Führen Sie den Check selbst durch"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes-example</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:440
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Open a terminal in the unpacked {ph0} folder:"
msgstr "Öffnen Sie ein Terminal im entpackten {ph0} Ordner:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:462
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"This command uses a shell with here-document support, such as Bash or Zsh. "
"Your agent can run the same JavaScript in your platform’s shell."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Befehl verwendet eine Shell mit here-Document-Unterstützung, z. B. "
"Bash oder Zsh. Ihr Agent kann denselben JavaScript in der Shell Ihrer "
"Plattform ausführen."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:470
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "5. Ask another question"
msgstr "5. Stellen Sie eine andere Frage"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:471
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Try a follow-up in the same conversation:"
msgstr "Versuchen Sie ein Follow-up im selben Gespräch:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:473
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"What happens if the file can’t be written? Follow the error back to the "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Was passiert, wenn die Datei nicht geschrieben werden kann? Folgen Sie dem "
"Fehler zurück zur Seite."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:478
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Or give your agent an app of your own and ask about one button, file or "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Oder geben Sie Ihrem Agenten eine eigene App und fragen Sie nach einer "
"Schaltfläche, Datei oder einem Verhalten."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/notion/">
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <span >
#. {ph3}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:483
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}How Notion copies text and HTML{ph1}{ph2}Follow a clipboard feature in "
"a packaged Electron app.{ph3}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Wie Notion Text und HTML kopiert{ph1}{ph2}Folgen Sie einer "
"Zwischenablage-Funktion in einer gepackten Electron-App.{ph3}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/dx-ball/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <span >
#. {ph3}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:489
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}How DX-Ball calculates sound panning{ph1}{ph2}Read the original "
"instructions and the reconstruction’s checks.{ph3}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Wie DX-Ball die Stereoklangpositionierung berechnet{ph1}{ph2}Lesen Sie "
