"Bildschirmkoordinatenbedeutung des Parameters C festgelegt {ph4}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FMUL</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x420068</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>read_bytes</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>1.5625</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:535
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Multiply by 1.5625.{ph1} {ph2} reads the double at {ph3}. The "
"bytes returned by REA's {ph4} decode to {ph5}; the C uses the same constant."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 * Multiplizieren Sie mit 1,5625.{ph1} {ph2} liest das Doppelte bei "
"{ph3}. Die von REAS zurückgegebenen Bytes {ph4} dekodieren zu {ph5}; das C "
"verwendet dieselbe Konstante."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FSUB</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x420070</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>500.0</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>320</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:541
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Subtract 500.0.{ph1} {ph2} reads the double at {ph3}. REA's byte "
"result decodes to {ph4}, shifting the calculation's center to screen "
"coordinate {ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 * Subtrahieren Sie 500,0.{ph1} {ph2} liest das Doppelte bei {ph3}.  "
"Das Byte-Ergebnis von REA dekodiert zu {ph4}, verschieben des "
"Berechnungsmittelpunkts auf die Bildschirmkoordinate {ph5}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FMUL</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x4210a0</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>dxball_pan_scale</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>1.0</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:547
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Apply the stored scale.{ph1} The second {ph2} reads {ph3}. That "
"global is named {ph4} in the maintained source. REA's second byte read "
"establishes its initial value of {ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}04 · Wenden Sie die gespeicherte Skala an.{ph1} Zweiten {ph2} lesen "
"{ph3}. Das Globale heißt {ph4} in der gepflegten Quelle.  Das zweite "
"gelesene Byte von REA legt den Anfangswert von fest {ph5}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>0x406430</code>
