#. {ph0}: <code>getSqliteMeta</code>
#: website/public/showcase/notion/index.html:549
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/notion/index.html"
msgid ""
"Notion's renderer requests {ph0} through IPC. The main process creates a "
"message channel and gives one port to the renderer and the other to a SQLite"
" utility process. Subsequent statement batches and results travel over that "
"port."
msgstr ""
"Renderer-Anfragen von Notion {ph0} durch IPC. Der Hauptprozess erstellt "
"einen Nachrichtenkanal und gibt einen Port an den Renderer und den anderen "
